// Wave 17E-4D (R2): Non-blocking operational write runtimes for `whole_daemon`:
// 1. `updates.install` (`POST /updates`, `id == "station"`) & `updates.wait` (`POST /updates/wait`):
//    - Disjoint `station_sys` `event_id` range `[15 << 32, 16 << 32)` (`UPDATES_RESTORE_EVENT_BASE..END`).
//    - Disjoint `MuxToken::Tagged` kinds `5330..5339`.
//    - Zero main-loop blocking: feed fetch uses `AdminStreamMode::WaitingAsyncOp` (`5330`/`5331`),
//      rollback archive download streams chunk-by-chunk with incremental SHA-256 (`5332`/`5333`) into
//      `<tmpdir>/stillfail-handed.<hex>/stillfail.tar.gz` (matching `cloud/src/install.ts:331-335`),
//      included-changes manifest fetch (`5336`/`5337`) and background wait-rule feed check (`5338`/`5339`).
//    - Pre-checks `<app>/bin/install.<lang>.<sh|ps1>` BEFORE any download (refuses `noInstaller` up front,
//      never writes fake `update-staged.json`). Copies installer to `<data>/run/install.sh` and launches it
//      detached with full inherited `env_all()` minus `STILLFAIL_ARCHIVE`/`STILLFAIL_INSTALLER_HANDED`,
//      never killed on handover or shutdown; follows `run/update.{started,step,exit,log}` across restarts.
//    - Rollback (`to`) persists `holdAuto` (`autoUpdate=false`, `autoUpdateAfter=<left>`) and restores it on failure.
//    - Runtime `updates.wait` coordinator evaluates `conditions_met`, verifies signed `included` manifest,
//      reconciles `autoUpdateWhen` when `OVERRIDE` is gone (`reconcile_override_wait`) & `autoUpdateAfter`
//      (`resume_auto`), and triggers updates when conditions are met.
// 2. `copies.restore` (`POST /copies/restore` -> immediate `202 { "restoring": true }`):
//    - Projects live `copies.restoring` + `copies.restored` into `GET /overview` + SSE.
//    - Non-blocking S3 SFB1 streaming restore (`5334`/`5335`), incremental non-blocking local-kept restore
//      (with full `transcriptManifest` + `transcriptFiles` closure), and real mesh `PeerPlace` (`replica.held`
//      / `replica.get`) via `ctx.ask_peer_rpc`.
//    - Validates heads via `station_replica::as_head` + `origin`/`gen` binding, uses a single shared
//      `ManifestBudget`, O(1) queue cursors, per-object 60s stall timeout (no 300s whole-restore cap),
//      fail-closed empty-station check, unconsumed `ready.json` protection, atomic cutover + `0600` `ready.json`,
//      and triggers controlled launcher restart (`on_restart`) so `before_store` imports the copy.
// 3. `xshare.hosts.put` (`PUT /xshare/hosts`):
//    - Real xshare cache invalidation (`xshare_listed`) + non-blocking `xshare.list` peer RPC reconciler
//      updating `borrowed` in atomic `0600` `<data>/xshare/state.json` + SSE.

